<title>USA: Negotiated muni sales to total $282 mln Thursday.</title>
<headline>Negotiated muni sales to total $282 mln Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $282 million in six offerings for Thursday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest is an $87 million Fort Worth, Texas, general obligation issue through Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
